The '''Pokémon Chronicles theme''' is an opening and ending theme produced for [[Pokémon Chronicles]]. This theme aired as an opening only with the {{DL|Pokémon in the United States|Toonami Jetstream}} airings of the series. The televised airings instead use the [[Pokérap GS#Pokémon Chronicles version|opening theme based on the ''Pokérap GS'']]. This is currently the only English opening theme in the {{pkmn|animated series}} to have no lyrics.

